  "title": "CFDE REVEAL",
  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"page_description\"><h3>CFDE-REVEAL: <small>Turn your research question into mechanistic leads</small></h3><p>Explore gene expression signatures linked to phenotypes, and get evidence-backed hypotheses about the biology behind them.</p><p>CFDE-REVEAL interprets your natural-language question, uses semantic search across CFDE resources and statistically backed gene-trait associations from the <a href=\"https://cfdeknowledge.org/r/kc_gsb?source=all&amp;model=cfde\">KC Gene Set Browser</a>, and leverages LLM-assisted reasoning to reveal hidden biological connections.</p><p><strong>Start</strong> by following the prompts below.</p><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/images/cfde/REVEAL_workflow.png\" width=\"1024\"></p></div>",
